      "writtenOn": "2021-08-14T04:57:14Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I was so so close to suppressing the mux error print on NOT_POWERED, but found one driver with the retimer power tied to a GPIO.  So we\u0027ll keep it there for that case where there\u0027s no other obvious EC prints to tell you the mux is off.",
      "parentUuid": "9afa1c56_a596f807",
      "revId": "d57d8602baa92efbddbd1dbd008ad42c6de53932",
