      "writtenOn": "2021-08-16T17:14:57Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "The state of most MUXes is NONE when power is cycled.  That is why the old code works well for most MUXes. ANX7451 seems to be an exception to the rule and power cycles to USB_ENABLED.  It is possible to make this device act as the norm and on leaving CHIPSET_STATE_HARD_OFF, the code could hook to initialize this MUX to NONE. Then the existing conditional status could remain and the warning output would vanish.",
      "parentUuid": "21d37d4b_b6438248",
      "revId": "d57d8602baa92efbddbd1dbd008ad42c6de53932",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
